            "exit_code": 0,
            "stdout_sha256": "f58845ba15c298c2d1755acd48696526098633040c6da6f456c25e9422f5f277",
            "failure_scenario": "A worker's next check overwrites its .running file, so the stale file only outlives the worker's LAST check: every later heartbeat names that finished check as still running, with a growing age, until the whole tree ends. Someone reading a stalled log is sent to a check that already passed. The pass/fail verdict is not affected.",
            "precision_class": "advisory"
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "mutant-survived-reaper-kill",
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "Mutant A7 SURVIVED: deleting the kill -TERM in the new reap_work trap (scripts/check_ladder_cells_producer.sh:28) leaves the check green. No fake apr serve was left after the mutant run (ps shows none), because a run that ends normally does not leak: the leak (#4919) needs a producer killed mid-run, and no row kills one."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
